# Compiled command entry points built into the workspace bin folder
/bin/

# Binary dropped in the project root by `go build ./tests/fixtures/topsailai`.
#
# Root-anchored on purpose: a bare `topsailai` pattern also matches the fixture
# source directory `tests/fixtures/topsailai/` at any depth, which would
# silently exclude that source tree from version control.
/topsailai
